## 4. Source Stance

- Every claim, number, quote must have a source link
- Default: inline clickable short anchor — `[S1](url)`
- Footer: unified `## Resources`
- Source quality follows two tracks:
  - **Disclosure fact track**: `topic-local evidence cache > primary public > Bridge > web`
  - **Market snapshot track**: `actuals market_data (fresh <180d) > Bridge > yfinance > WebSearch / WebFetch`
- `financial-data` CLI is source-of-record → `actuals-resolved.json`; artifact financial data must come from actuals
- Bridge = Longbridge MCP (US/HK/SH/SZ/SG), auto-fallback if unavailable
- Full data routing table → `.references/routing/data-routing.md`

